  0.6, 0.4, 0.2],ExpressionUUID->"615dfd1b-0052-45c7-8998-3c2dc5258dbc"],

Cell["\<\
Need both dimention AND Phase to Define structure.

Each dimention has phases
\tThe phases are quantum in nature
\tEach dimention has phase specific phase max count
\tDim NULL = NULL
\tDim 1 has 2
\tDim 2 has 4
\tDim 3 has 8
\
\>", "Text",
