Quernions, Octonions, Sedunion,...\nWhere get phase^2 get vector projection \
into Reals -1\nDraw map table peridioc table polyhedrian object\nShould see \
someltrhing reconmoibel\n\[LineSeparator]\n5/23/2016\n",
