Cell[TextData[{
 "Null === TheGestalt\n\nTheGestalt === \
{Gestalt[[N]],Conjugate[Gestalt[[N]]]}            N Pairs    N = \
\[OpenCurlyQuote]Count Phase\[CloseCurlyQuote] = number of reflections     N \
= {1,2,3,..,N,N+1}\n\nPair production: Gestalt and Conjugate of Gestalt --- \
The pair is the conceptional, neither exist without the other. the Conjugate \
is the \[OpenCurlyQuote]shaddow\[CloseCurlyQuote] of \
\[OpenCurlyQuote]something\[CloseCurlyQuote] on the Null plane. Something = \
not Null  the shaddow the \[OpenCurlyQuote]hole\[CloseCurlyQuote] (think \
simiconductor doping) left in the Null by \[OpenCurlyQuote]Something\
\[CloseCurlyQuote] \n\nConjugent = Reflection = Rotation = Spin = Toruq = \
vector (\[OpenCurlyQuote]away\[CloseCurlyQuote], negitive with count 1, no \
spacal but  ALL dimitional complex plain directions of away. Need to sho that \
perojects into the reals as a vector with no specal demention just \
\[OpenCurlyQuote]-\[OpenCurlyQuote] (Away from observer, where obsver was at \
start of measurment [minimum measrment one reflection]) the time diminiont; \
tork of the complex.sponior Plankette  See MacGreagoe Power of Alpha ch 5 up \
and his zeons. \n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlanko ===  Gestalt[[i]] and Conjugate of \
Gestalt[[i]] of Set N\n\nPlanko very by phase, only one phase per Planko, \
phases outhorgnormal --- Pauli exclusing prisiple on phase phase = count \
Reflections from arbertary start point\n\n\nPlankette === Set Planko Pairs \
through N\n\nObservation === Reflection\[AliasDelimiter]\n\n\n",
 StyleBox["Count is a phase properity. Two requires a reflection. a 180 \
degree rotation or Pi \n",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]],
 "\n\n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.58302884375*^9, 3.58302884721875*^9}, 
